      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's all gone, Elara. the kingdom, the people, even the reason i fought in the first place. i wake up every morning and i just feel this weight, like the world is too heavy to carry anymore. i don't think there's anything left of me to save. i'm just so tired of trying to find a way forward when there's nothing there.",
